# Web Site Rules (apps/web)

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 15 with App Router
- Tailwind CSS 4
- Framer Motion for animations
- Server Components by default, client only when interactive

## Conventions
- Pages in `src/app/` following Next.js App Router conventions
- Components in `src/components/` — kebab-case files, PascalCase exports
- Utilities in `src/lib/`
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/cn` for class merging

## SEO Requirements
- Every page needs proper `metadata` export
- Use `generateMetadata` for dynamic pages
- OpenGraph images for key pages
- Structured data (JSON-LD) where appropriate

## Design
- Pure black background (#000000), white text only — NO gradients, NO color accents
- Font: Plus Jakarta Sans (sans), JetBrains Mono (code)
- Monochromatic geek aesthetic: dense info, sharp borders, terminal-inspired
- See `_internal/marketing/brand/GUIDELINES.md` for full brand guide

## Deploy
- Vercel
- Environment variables via Vercel dashboard
